# Copy to .env for local development. On Vercel, set these as Environment Variables
# instead — the app reads process.env first and only falls back to this file.

# Required. Lyzr Agent Studio API key; every agent call uses it.
LYZR_API_KEY=

# Optional but strongly recommended. Apollo enrichment: the company record, the partner's
# logo for the brief, and the only thing that works when a site sits behind a WAF.
# Without it the agent still runs, from the crawl alone.
APOLLO_API_KEY=

# Optional. Web search, so the profile can see launch posts, partnerships and coverage
# that are not on the company's own services pages. Set whichever one you have; the code
# picks the first key it finds. Without any of them the profile is built from the crawl
# and Apollo alone, exactly as before.
#   serper.dev        2,500 free searches, fastest, returns links we fetch ourselves
#   tavily.com        1,000 free/month, returns extracted page text, no fetch needed
#   brave.com/search/api
SERPER_API_KEY=
TAVILY_API_KEY=
BRAVE_API_KEY=
